SDL-E1022 (spec/README.md#design-rules-settled)

  x a silo module is self-named — remove the header name (the 3.3 silo form takes no alias)
   ,----
 1 | module color { from: silo::acme::utils::<1.2.0>; unsigned; };
   :        ^^|^^
   :          `-- module name does not fit its executable
   `----
  help: the header name must fit the executable: file modules take `module <name> { … };`, silo modules take none
